{"id":"434972","name":"白萝卜羊骨汤","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/434972/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"羊骨","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"半个"},{"name":"食盐","amount":"0.3克"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"小许"},{"name":"陈醋","amount":"小许"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菜","amount":"小许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"羊骨泡洗干净。","img":"images/434972/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"冷水下锅。","img":"images/434972/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"盖锅盖。","img":"images/434972/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"煮开锅即可。","img":"images/434972/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"冷水洗掉浮末。","img":"images/434972/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放电压力锅里，加清水，加1克食盐。","img":"images/434972/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"煮25分钟。","img":"images/434972/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"白萝卜洗净，切一半。","img":"images/434972/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"白萝卜改刀。","img":"images/434972/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"切宽条。","img":"images/434972/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放羊骨汤锅里，煮10分钟即可，没有10分钟档位，自己定时的。","img":"images/434972/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"香菜洗净切末。","img":"images/434972/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放进打开的压力锅里。","img":"images/434972/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"碗里放陈醋和精及小许食盐。","img":"images/434972/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/434972/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/434972/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}